VLANS CLI
vlan #
name VLAN-NAME

VLAN port ASSIGNING
int port#
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan #
spanning-tree portfast
switchport voice vlan # !(note: this is use for voice vlan if voice vlan no need to use switchport mode access)
no shut

verification
sh vlan br or sh vlan b
---------------------------------------------
---------------------------------------------
TRUNKING switch

switchport mode trunk !!(if error in mode trunk use the next CLI)
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q !!(then use the first CLI again)
switchport trunk native vlan # !(allowed to use another vlan for trunkin not the default 1)
switchport trunk allowed vlan # !(ranges vlan #)
switchport trunk allowed vlan add Vlan # !(add specific vlan #)
switchport trunk allowed vlan remove Vlan # !(remove specific vlan #)

verification
sh cdp nei (check connection status)
sh int trunk
