DHCP Command
ip dhcp pool NaME
network x.x.x.x x.x.x.x !(ip add subnet mask)
default-router x.x.x.x !(the ip address of the SVI or subinterfaces)
dns-server 8.8.8.8
domain-name NAME.COM

Voice DHCP
for ip dhcp pool VOICE
network x.x.x.x x.x.x.x !(ip add subnet mask)
default-router x.x.x.x !(address of the SVI/Subinterface)
option 150 ip x.x.x.x !(ip add) @ip address of the CME-Router

!optional
ip dhcp excluded-address x.x.x.x x.x.x.x !(ip addresses) !for ranges

verification
sh ip dhcp pool
sh ip dhcp binding
